Batched translation for LibreTranslate batch requests (q as a list).

ITranslation.translate_batch() translates several texts with the same result as
translate() on each, but PackageTranslation sends the sentences of all texts to
CTranslate2 in one translate_batch() call instead of one call per text. On CPU
that is several times faster: decoding steps are shared by the whole batch.
Pivot (CompositeTranslation) and cached translations pass the batch through.

Also keeps argostranslate's INFO logs (every sentence with its tokens) out of the
journal unless ARGOS_DEBUG is set.

